WEBVTT

1
00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:16.097
"We can't let Meltron get away!"

2
00:00:16.517 --> 00:00:17.137
Roxy said.

3
00:00:18.418 --> 00:00:20.680
The damaged robot was flying away from Groon.

4
00:00:22.521 --> 00:00:24.742
"We'll use my energy blaster," Dr.

5
00:00:24.842 --> 00:00:25.323
Odd said.

6
00:00:25.343 --> 00:00:27.164
"Follow me."

7
00:00:31.512 --> 00:00:33.973
He led the group to a control center in another room.

8
00:00:37.334 --> 00:00:39.195
He pressed some buttons and flipped a switch.

9
00:00:41.636 --> 00:00:42.296
Nothing happened.

10
00:00:46.118 --> 00:00:48.419
energy blaster doesn't seem to be working!"

11
00:00:48.919 --> 00:00:49.639
Cozlin said.

12
00:00:49.659 --> 00:00:51.540
"Is it broken?"

13
00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:52.641
Roxy asked.

14
00:00:52.661 --> 00:00:54.981
"Give it a minute," Dr.

15
00:00:55.101 --> 00:00:55.602
Odd said.

16
00:00:58.983 --> 00:01:01.024
Roxy felt the moon begin to shake slightly.

17
00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:02.720
Then Whoomp!

18
00:01:03.841 --> 00:01:07.222
A shimmering form moved quickly from the moon toward Meltron.

19
00:01:09.782 --> 00:01:11.243
Suddenly Meltron vanished!

20
00:01:17.404 --> 00:01:19.645
"The demon got away!"

21
00:01:20.085 --> 00:01:20.885
Wukong said.

22
00:01:21.766 --> 00:01:22.886
Cozlin rolled her eyes.

23
00:01:22.906 --> 00:01:25.967
"He's not a demon, Wukong."

24
00:01:27.327 --> 00:01:28.307
Dr. Odd chuckled.

25
00:01:31.904 --> 00:01:33.005
"He didn't get away.

26
00:01:33.866 --> 00:01:36.467
The energy blast turned him into a cloud of atoms.

27
00:01:37.448 --> 00:01:39.009
He doesn't exist anymore."

28
00:01:43.472 --> 00:01:45.674
"Whoa," Cozlin said.

29
00:01:45.694 --> 00:01:48.876
"My planet doesn't have anything like that!"

30
00:01:48.896 --> 00:01:53.099
"Boring, you," Bippo said.

31
00:01:54.140 --> 00:01:55.020
Roxy frowned.

32
00:01:55.040 --> 00:01:57.522
"Not nice, Bippo."

33
00:01:57.542 --> 00:01:59.924
"Sorry, me."

34
00:02:03.396 --> 00:02:05.477
"I should go home," Wukong said.

35
00:02:05.497 --> 00:02:08.638
"I need to destroy the Demon of Mighty Roots.

36
00:02:09.499 --> 00:02:12.500
And the Tang Monk still has a long way to go on his journey.

37
00:02:15.281 --> 00:02:16.321
But this has been fun!

38
00:02:18.002 --> 00:02:21.624
If you ever need me to save your galaxy again, come and get me!"

39
00:02:22.944 --> 00:02:23.825
Roxy smiled.

40
00:02:23.845 --> 00:02:25.925
"We will, Wukong.

41
00:02:26.226 --> 00:02:26.746
Good luck!"

42
00:02:29.787 --> 00:02:30.928
Cozlin opened the portal.

43
00:02:32.136 --> 00:02:35.037
Everyone saw the tree demon lying motionless on the ground.

44
00:02:37.297 --> 00:02:41.018
Wukong jumped through and swung his iron bar as the portal swirled shut.

45
00:02:42.019 --> 00:02:45.540
"I have to go home too," Cozlin said.

46
00:02:45.560 --> 00:02:49.421
"I need to help clean up the mess that the robots made.

47
00:02:50.481 --> 00:02:52.962
We'll need to rebuild a lot of things too."

48
00:02:52.982 --> 00:02:56.663
"Take the spaceship," Dr.

49
00:02:56.763 --> 00:02:57.303
Odd said.

50
00:02:57.323 --> 00:02:59.583
"I have a few others."

51
00:03:01.084 --> 00:03:02.861
"Thank you," Cozlin said.

52
00:03:05.962 --> 00:03:07.163
Roxy, Terrell, and Dr.

53
00:03:07.243 --> 00:03:08.884
Odd watched Cozlin zoom away.

54
00:03:12.226 --> 00:03:12.746
Then Dr.

55
00:03:12.826 --> 00:03:14.407
Odd programmed a route back to Earth.

56
00:03:14.427 --> 00:03:21.291
"Even with my advanced hyper-speed, the trip will take about a day," he said.

57
00:03:23.892 --> 00:03:26.354
He showed Roxy and Terrell to a pair of guest rooms.

58
00:03:29.075 --> 00:03:30.036
Everyone went to sleep.

59
00:03:34.476 --> 00:03:38.357
The next morning, as they ate breakfast, Roxy saw Earth in the distance.

60
00:03:42.578 --> 00:03:45.319
Dr. Odd flew them down to Metro City in a spaceship.

61
00:03:51.161 --> 00:03:52.161
"What will you do now?"

62
00:03:52.541 --> 00:03:53.301
Terrell asked him.

63
00:03:53.321 --> 00:03:57.122
"The Groonians are out there somewhere," Dr.

64
00:03:57.203 --> 00:03:57.703
Odd said.

65
00:03:57.723 --> 00:04:02.264
"I'll find them and tell them they can safely return home now."

66
00:04:05.196 --> 00:04:05.956
"Okay, Dr.

67
00:04:06.136 --> 00:04:08.257
Odd." Roxy smiled.

68
00:04:08.277 --> 00:04:13.178
"But remember—you're a member of the Galaxy Squad.

69
00:04:13.638 --> 00:04:17.940
If there's big trouble "I'll come right back!"

70
00:04:18.380 --> 00:04:19.700
Dr. Odd said with a laugh.

71
00:04:19.720 --> 00:04:23.541
"Superhero, him," Bippo said.

72
00:04:24.381 --> 00:04:27.282
Everyone laughed.

73
00:04:27.402 --> 00:04:30.043
"Come on, Bippo," Dr.

74
00:04:30.163 --> 00:04:30.683
Odd said.

75
00:04:30.703 --> 00:04:33.144
"We have an important mission!"

76
00:04:38.860 --> 00:04:39.820
Bippo followed Dr.

77
00:04:39.920 --> 00:04:40.921
Odd into the spaceship.

78
00:04:43.902 --> 00:04:46.262
Roxy and Terrell waved and then watched it blast off.

79
00:04:50.263 --> 00:04:51.804
Terrell," Roxy said.

80
00:04:51.824 --> 00:04:54.085
"I was wrong about people.

81
00:04:55.185 --> 00:04:57.125
I now know that they can change."

82
00:04:57.145 --> 00:04:59.426
"Good," Terrell said.

83
00:04:59.446 --> 00:05:03.347
"So you'll stop being mad at the kid who made fun of my glasses?"

84
00:05:04.888 --> 00:05:05.588
Roxy nodded.

85
00:05:06.816 --> 00:05:11.499
"But if he ever makes fun of you again, he'll have Rocket Girl to deal with!"

86
00:05:11.519 --> 00:05:17.323
"Actually Terrell grinned as they started walking toward home.

87
00:05:17.343 --> 00:05:27.430
"If he does it again, he'll have something else to deal with—the Galaxy Squad!"
